    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNDER CONSTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is a work in progress</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/b85f54562047936cbbb5458748a45cb1.poster.avif?t=1749491097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/b85f54562047936cbbb5458748a45cb1.webm?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/b85f54562047936cbbb5458748a45cb1.mp4?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Elements to Make Unique Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fusion Mage, swap to a variety of spells on the fly by <strong>channeling elements</strong>. Acquire more elements for a deep well of strategic magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose the Right Spells for the Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spells are more favorable in certain places. Different things react to your spells in unique ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/6b8900dc4a1f586a68dea932629e23a5.poster.avif?t=1749491097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/6b8900dc4a1f586a68dea932629e23a5.webm?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/6b8900dc4a1f586a68dea932629e23a5.mp4?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful equipment is available at the shop, if you've got the gems. These items assist general and specific strategies alike. Trinkets give big upgrades, while potions can be used in a pinch.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNDER CONSTRUCTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is a work in progress</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/b85f54562047936cbbb5458748a45cb1.poster.avif?t=1749491097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/b85f54562047936cbbb5458748a45cb1.webm?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/b85f54562047936cbbb5458748a45cb1.mp4?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Elements to Make Unique Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fusion Mage, swap to a variety of spells on the fly by <strong>channeling elements</strong>. Acquire more elements for a deep well of strategic magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose the Right Spells for the Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spells are more favorable in certain places. Different things react to your spells in unique ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/6b8900dc4a1f586a68dea932629e23a5.poster.avif?t=1749491097\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/6b8900dc4a1f586a68dea932629e23a5.webm?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430730/extras/6b8900dc4a1f586a68dea932629e23a5.mp4?t=1749491097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful equipment is available at the shop, if you've got the gems. These items assist general and specific strategies alike. Trinkets give big upgrades, while potions can be used in a pinch.</p>",
